Graphics -- Graphics
********************

Description
===========

This package provides graphic primitives and functions to turn them into
pictures in different formats. The formats supported include svg and pgf/tikz.

Authors
=======

  * Baptiste Calmes (see http://bcalmes.perso.math.cnrs.fr/ )
  * Viktor Petrov

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.3 of Graphics, released June 4, 2013.

