mergeFormattedGraphicPrimitives(FormattedGraphicPrimitives,FormattedGraphicPrimitives) -- merge two lists of graphic primitives with options
********************************************************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note mergeFormattedGraphicPrimitives:
    mergeFormattedGraphicPrimitives,
  * Usage: 
        mergeFormattedGraphicPrimitives(fgp1,fgp2)
  * Inputs:
      * fgp1, an instance of the type *note FormattedGraphicPrimitives:
        FormattedGraphicPrimitives,,
      * fgp2, an instance of the type *note FormattedGraphicPrimitives:
        FormattedGraphicPrimitives,,
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * keep
      * priority
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note FormattedGraphicPrimitives:
        FormattedGraphicPrimitives,,

Description
===========

The list of graphic primitives are concatenated and the graphic options are
merged according to the value of two options "keep" (either "1or2", "1" or "2")
and "priority" (either "1" or "2").

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : myoptions1= new HashTable from {"fill"=>"black"}                        |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = HashTable{"fill" => black}                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : HashTable                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : myoptions2= new HashTable from {"fill"=>"blue","stroke"=>"red"}         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = HashTable{"fill" => blue }                                              |
|               "stroke" => red                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : HashTable                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : fgp1=formatGraphicPrimitives({point(20,30),point(40,50)},myoptions1)    |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = FormattedGraphicPrimitives{{Point2D{20, 30}, Point2D{40, 50}}, HashTable|
|                                                                             |
|o3 : FormattedGraphicPrimitives                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{"fill" => black}}                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : fgp2=formatGraphicPrimitives({circle(point(30,40),10)},myoptions2)      |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = FormattedGraphicPrimitives{{Circle{Point2D{30, 40}, 10}}, HashTable{"   |
|                                                                         "   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : FormattedGraphicPrimitives                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|fill" => blue }}                                                             |
|stroke" => red                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : mergeFormattedGraphicPrimitives(fgp1,fgp2)                              |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = FormattedGraphicPrimitives{{Point2D{20, 30}, Point2D{40, 50},           |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : FormattedGraphicPrimitives                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Circle{Point2D{30, 40}, 10}}, HashTable{"fill" => black}}                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : mergeFormattedGraphicPrimitives(fgp1,fgp2,"keep"=>"2","priority"=>"1    |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = FormattedGraphicPrimitives{{Point2D{20, 30}, Point2D{40, 50}, Circle    |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : FormattedGraphicPrimitives                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|")                                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|{Point2D{30, 40}, 10}}, HashTable{"fill" => black}}                          |
|                                  "stroke" => red                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

